          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> Three or more living creatures come within 90ft of the hazard.</p><p><strong>Effect</strong> The hazard glows brightly as it activates, twisting roots up from the ground. Those affected must do a @Check[reflex|dc:30|basic] save. Those who fail are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} (Escape DC equal to the reflex save DC). The Hazard rolls initiative.</p>"
