        "category": null,
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>Briars grow and twist from the ground surrounding the Bramble Orb. This effect does not harm its allies. Intruders caught in this emanation and within 15ft of the ground must do a @Check[reflex|dc:30|basic|options:primal,divine,plant] save or take @Damage[(2d12+15)[piercing]|options:primal,divine,plant].</p><p>Anyone that fails must do a @Check[fortitude|dc:30|basic] save or have their blood drained by the roots becoming @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 1} on a failure (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 2} on a critical failure).</p><p>To track the radius, apply @UUID[Compendium.covalon.briarmurk-items.Item.Bzd6mzPrkoidCWZ8]{Tangled Briar Thicket (T3-T5)} and left click the effect once each time an action is removed.</p>"
        },
